  "invite1": "I lit a light on Mood Whisper. The more people nearby, the brighter our block gets. Come light it up with me:",
  "invite2": "The city is a little quiet tonight. Write a mood on Mood Whisper and help our block light up:",
  "invite3": "No friend requests, no real names, just one line about how you feel. Find me on Mood Whisper:",
  "invite4": "I left a light on for you on Mood Whisper. Open the app and see what people nearby are feeling tonight:",
  "invite5": "Every Friday at 9 pm is Light-up Night on Mood Whisper. Come online with me and let's fill the radar with light:",
  "invite6": "Need somewhere to say how today went? Mood Whisper is anonymous, and your words fade once they're said:",
  "invite7": "Ever wonder what the people you pass on the street are feeling? See for yourself on Mood Whisper:",
  "invite8": "I left a whisper on this street that only passers-by can read. Come leave one too:",
  "invite9": "Mood Whisper is a map of the city's moods at night. It's more fun with more people, so come add a light to our block:",
  "invite10": "What colour is your mood tonight? Write it on Mood Whisper. I'll be nearby, watching for your light:",
