  "intro1Title": "Slip into the city",
  "intro1Body": "Leave the social labels behind. On a quiet dark canvas, all that remains is how you truly feel, and where.",
  "intro2Title": "A passing moment",
  "intro2Body": "See a mood bubble floating nearby? Knock gently and share a once-in-a-lifetime conversation with someone passing by.",
  "intro3Title": "The city's rhythm",
  "intro3Body": "We care how you feel. After you knock, wait quietly for an answer. If it isn't meant to be, the bubble fades away after 300 seconds.",
  "intro4Title": "A gentle distance",
  "intro4Body": "Don't want to be disturbed? Decline or block. A cool-down system keeps the noise away and gives you back your quiet corner.",
  "intro5Title": "Ready to meet?",
  "intro5Body": "Close your eyes and feel your phone's pulse and your heartbeat. Now write how you feel, check in here and step into Mood Whisper.",
  "intro6Title": "A letter to your future self",
  "intro6Body": "Leave a few words in this very spot for yourself a month or a year from now. It opens only when you come back.",
  "intro7Title": "Glow together tonight",
  "intro7Body": "Host a gathering with one emoji as the secret sign. Everyone who adds it to their name gets your announcements, and the whole block lights up together.",
  "intro8Title": "Parallel Universe",
  "intro8Body": "Tap the globe and Taiwan's cities overlap with Tokyo, Seoul and Kuala Lumpur. See how people far away feel right now, knock and chat, and tap to translate.",
