  "guideS16Title": "10. Mood Places",
  "guideS16L1": "Mood Places are independent cafés we partner with. After you check in, walk within 150 m of one while it is open and a small lamp appears on your radar, slowly breathing. It goes out when you walk away.",
  "guideS16L2": "Tap the lamp to open the place card: a night view from inside, today's closing time, a one-line mood story from the café (tap to translate), the address and phone number. Tap Walk there to get walking directions in your map app. A lamp whose card you opened today glows softly without breathing.",
  "guideS16L3": "The first time you pass, a small card at the top lets you know, with no sound or vibration. You get at most one hint per place every 7 days and 2 hints a day. Turn them off in Settings > Mood Place hints; the lamps stay.",
  "guideS16L4": "The whole list of places is downloaded to your phone, and whether you are nearby is worked out only on your phone. Neither we nor the cafés know which places you pass. Cafés cannot pay for visibility. If something is wrong, report it at the bottom of the card.",
