  "quantumResonance": "You and {name} are resonating",
  "guideS17L6": "Hourly chime: a minute before each hour the 101 beam brightens. On the hour, messengers of light circle the origin, the bell strikes Quantum Center time (24 strikes at midnight), and a final wave of light sweeps the hive. Tap “Send a chime glimmer” during the chime — the more people watching, the brighter it gets. The hourly chime reminder is on by default; you can turn it off in the panel.",
  "guideS17L7": "After chatting, you can invite someone to entangle: a line of light joins your bubbles however far apart you are, collapsing when either of you leaves (up to 3 at a time). Quantum tunnelling, once per visit, jumps you to a random empty seat with new neighbours.",
  "guideS17L8": "Each bubble carries the tint of its owner's local time: pale gold at dawn, bright white by day, orange-violet at dusk, deep blue at night. Turn on “Show my local time” to let others see the time when they long-press your bubble. Swapping glimmers within 24 hours makes you resonate; long-press a bubble to send a 👋 ☕ 🌙 🎵 🌧️ ✨ signal; pick up to 3 wavelength topics in the panel and shared ones light up.",
  "quantumNyTitle": "Quantum New Year",
  "quantumNyDays": "{n} days to go: at Quantum Center midnight on 12/31, count down with the world at the 101 origin",
  "quantumNyTonight": "Tonight at Quantum Center midnight, count down with the world at the 101 origin",
