  "quantumNyHappy": "Happy New Year",
  "guideS17L9": "Quantum New Year: on 12/31, as each time zone reaches midnight, its bubbles light up with golden rings in waves, and world-view dots turn gold too. At Quantum Center midnight the whole hive counts down the last 10 seconds, the 101 origin releases the world's biggest burst of light and 5 minutes of fireworks, and you see how many people crossed into the new year together.",
