  "aiyaPackEntry": "+ Time packs",
  "aiyaPacksTitle": "Time packs",
  "aiyaPacksBody": "You get 3 free chats a day. Time pack chats are only used after the free ones run out. Each chat lasts up to 10 minutes.",
  "guideS1L6": "If your location can't be found (for example indoors, or on an iPad without GPS), tap \"Choose on the map\": move the map so the glowing dot in the middle sits where you are, then tap \"I'm here\". Once a real location comes in, the app switches to it.",
  "guideS17L11": "Quantum avatar: tap your seat code at the top left → \"Quantum avatar\" and your avatar becomes a crystal orb in Quantum World. Glow and Ring are free; Rainbow is a one-time purchase you keep forever, and \"Restore purchases\" brings it back on a new phone or after reinstalling.",
  "guideS18Title": "14. AIYA · AI",
  "guideS18L1": "AIYA is an AI who lives in the light pillar at the center of Quantum World. She is not a person, and she will tell you so. In Quantum World, tap \"AIYA · AI\" under the pillar to knock and chat; before your first chat you read a short notice and agree.",
  "guideS18L2": "Each chat lasts up to 10 minutes and 20 messages. You get 3 free chats a day, reset at 00:00 Taiwan time, with a maximum of 30 chats a day.",
  "guideS18L3": "Time packs: tap \"+ Time packs\" above the message box at any time to buy 5 or 20 chats; they are only used after your free chats run out. Time packs belong to the account on this phone and cannot be recovered after you delete the app or your account. They are consumable, so there is no \"Restore purchases\".",
  "guideS18L4": "AIYA doesn't know and won't ask your location or identity; she only sees anonymous city mood totals. She won't flirt or discuss sexual content, and she doesn't give medical, legal or financial advice. Long-press any reply to report it. Chats are only kept for the current conversation and are deleted shortly after it ends.",
  "guideS18L5": "Now and then AIYA appears in the light pillar: at the hourly chime, the first time you enter Quantum World each day, or by chance. Tap her to start chatting. To stop seeing her, turn off \"AIYA (AI in Quantum World)\" in Settings.",
