  "aiyaFriendLeft": "AIYA Friend · {n} left today",
  "guideS17L12": "Limited looks: the Christmas crystal orb (holly wreath, twinkling gold star, falling snow) is sold until 12/25, and the Quantum New Year crystal orb (gold clock ticks and bursting fireworks, extra big at the stroke of midnight) until 1/1, Taiwan time. After that they are never sold again; if you bought one you keep it forever and can restore it.",
  "guideS18L6": "AIYA Friend: choose \"AIYA Friend\" under \"+ Time Pack\". It is an auto-renewing monthly plan: 20 chats a day, each up to 20 minutes or 40 messages, chats even while AIYA is resting, and a \"Starlight\" look on AIYA that only you see. Time-pack chats are used only after the 20 daily chats. The subscription renews automatically; cancel any time in your Apple or Google subscription settings, and tap \"Restore purchases\" on a new phone.",
  "mapConsentTitle": "Show your location on the map?",
  "mapConsentBody": "If you allow this, each time you tap Check in (or Enter in the Quantum World) yourself, other users see the spot where you checked in (not your live position), your nickname and your mood on the map. There is no automatic check-in, and you disappear from the map when you leave the app. You can decline, and you can turn this off any time in Settings.",
