  "guideS19Title": "15. Whisper Groups",
  "guideS19L1": "A Whisper Group is a private group for trips, school outings, hikes, outings or event staff. Go to Settings → Gatherings → \"Start a group\", give it a name, pick a color and the number of days (up to 7).",
  "guideS19L2": "Joining: the leader taps the group button at the bottom of the map → \"QR code\"; members scan it with the phone camera and the app opens to join. Or go to Settings → Gatherings → \"Join a group\" and enter the 8-character code. Outsiders cannot search for or request to join, and the leader can replace the QR code at any time.",
  "guideS19L3": "Calling everyone: the leader taps \"Call everyone\", picks a time and describes the meeting point. Members' phones play a special sound with a \"short short long\" vibration; in the app they see a countdown, the distance and direction to the meeting point, and a pillar of light on the map. Anyone who has not tapped \"Got it\" is reminded once a minute, up to 3 times; the leader sees who got it, who saw it and who has not responded.",
  "guideS19L4": "Roll call: the leader taps \"Roll call\"; members get the same sound and vibration and tap \"I'm here\", \"5 more min\" or \"Need help\". The leader never sees members' locations, only their replies.",
  "guideS19L5": "Groups of up to 20 people are free. For more, the leader can buy the group 7-day plan: up to 100 people until the group ends. Members never pay. A group lasts at most 7 days; when it expires or the leader ends it, the list and records are deleted.",
  "wgFlagButton": "Raise flag",
