  "wgNavigate": "Directions",
  "wgFoundThem": "Found them",
  "guideS19L6": "Finding each other: in a crowd, tap \"Raise flag\" and your whole screen flashes in the group color with your number; hold it up so others can spot you. If a member really gets separated, they can tap \"I'm lost\" to send their current location to the leader once (deleted after 30 minutes). The leader's phone alerts them, a red pin appears on the map, and they can get directions.",
